    "detailed_description": "Start your journey as a group of outcasts to slowly find your place inside a dystopian high-rise cybercity full of opportunities and contrasts. Keep satisfying the needs of each member, get them a safe house, collect cash one way or another, make necessary connections and expand to neighboring districts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/52e852d7bfbe39ee45800e4e23ec7149.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/52e852d7bfbe39ee45800e4e23ec7149.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/52e852d7bfbe39ee45800e4e23ec7149.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>AI-driven crew</strong><br>Hire members, equip them and give something to do - every crew member awaits orders and a plan, and each of them has their own way of doing things. Find a way to reach them and send to places where they can fully use their individual pros.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/7cfedd28030e4c6220f6fed37b977851.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/7cfedd28030e4c6220f6fed37b977851.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/7cfedd28030e4c6220f6fed37b977851.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Top of the food chain</strong><br>Dash through the ground floors of the low level city, deal with everything and everyone who wants to exploit you, get to the districts above and eventually see the sun through a slightly less polluted air. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/ec0cff8c4fca6401d381469e759e58e5.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/ec0cff8c4fca6401d381469e759e58e5.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/ec0cff8c4fca6401d381469e759e58e5.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dark &amp; dystopian city</strong><br>Dive in a polluted, rusty but always vibrant city. Beware the cops and corps, find your way to survive whether it's a new business, getting things done for other crews or just looting around.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/1ebbaa64172be40320e076b158ec08c0.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/1ebbaa64172be40320e076b158ec08c0.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/1ebbaa64172be40320e076b158ec08c0.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Cybertech equipment</strong><br>Make technology work for you. Buy, craft, repair and install cyberware on your gang members to increase their stats and a chance to win against the City.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/a024f04b584d16146aaefd23067082e0.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/a024f04b584d16146aaefd23067082e0.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/a024f04b584d16146aaefd23067082e0.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
