 and eventually see the sun through a slightly less polluted air. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/ec0cff8c4fca6401d381469e759e58e5.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/ec0cff8c4fca6401d381469e759e58e5.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/ec0cff8c4fca6401d381469e759e58e5.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Dark &amp; dystopian city</strong><br>Dive in a polluted, rusty but always vibrant city. Beware the cops and corps, find your way to survive whether it's a new business, getting things done for other crews or just looting around.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/1ebbaa64172be40320e076b158ec08c0.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/1ebbaa64172be40320e076b158ec08c0.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/1ebbaa64172be40320e076b158ec08c0.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Cybertech equipment</strong><br>Make technology work for you. Buy, craft, repair and install cyberware on your gang members to increase their stats and a chance to win against the City.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/a024f04b584d16146aaefd23067082e0.poster.avif?t=1734509606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/a024f04b584d16146aaefd23067082e0.webm?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518120/extras/a024f04b584d16146aaefd23067082e0.mp4?t=1734509606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "A cyberpunk colony simulator where you take over, manage &amp; build bases, create &amp; lead the crew to survive in a dark cybercity. Every member of the society makes their own decisions based on various factors and stats, for you is to decide and point out what would be best to do next!",
